  diseaseName: "GASTROENTER\u0130T"
  generalInfo: "Gastroenterit, mide ve ba\u011F\u0131rsaklar\u0131n enfeksiyonuna
    ba\u011Fl\u0131 geli\u015Fen akut sindirim sistemi hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r.
    Hastalarda ishal, bulant\u0131 ve kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "ishal mevcut olmas\u0131, bulant\u0131 ve kusma, kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131
    var olmas\u0131 ve hafif ate\u015F mevcut olmas\u0131 gastroenteritte s\u0131k
    g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131 hastalarda halsizlik mevcut olabilir."
